{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-015.md","record_count":36,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாங்க, நான்தான் கரண்ட்! இந்தக் கம்பெனிலே அசிஸ்டெண்ட்! ஒங்களுக்கு என்னு வாண்ட்டு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உங்க முதலாளியைப் பார்க்கலாம்னு வந்தேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன விசேஷம்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒங்க கம்பெனியிலே 'டைப்பிஸ்டு' தேவைன்னு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுவா? எங்க கம்பெனிக்கு, பொம்பளை டைப்பிஸ்ட் வேண்டியதில்லே! ஆம்பளைதான் வேணும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்படி ஒண்ணும் போர்டுல போடலியே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடடா! நான் அப்பவே சொன்னேன்; கேட்டானா அந்த போர்டு எழுதுறவன்! பரவாயில்லே அதை மாத்தி எழுதிடறோம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தாப்பா! ப்ளீஸ், ஒங்க முதலாளியை பாக்கும்படியா ஏற்பாடு பண்ணேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அவரை பார்க்க முடியாதும்மா! அவரு ஒரு மாருதி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மாட்டே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மாட்டேன், இந்த வீண் வம்புல நான் மாட்டவே மாட்டேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா அம்மா! இந்தாங்க. இந்தாங்க! அடடா, அடடா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரு, லீலாவா? அடடே...வா லீலா, வா, வா! உட்காரு, உட்காரு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":28,"printed_page":27}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சார் சார், இந்தம்மா நான் சொல்ல சொல்ல உள்ளே வந்துட்டாங்க சார்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கெடாவுட், ராஸ்கல்! டேய், ஒன்னைத்தான்டா, யாரு என்னுன்னு தெரியாம ஒளறிக்கிட்டு போடா; போயி காப்பி, சோடா, ரெஷ் எல்லாம் வாங்கிட்டு வாடா; மூஞ்சியைப் பாரு...நீ ஒக்காரு லீலா, என்ன லீலா செளக்கியமெல்லாம் எப்படி? வீட்ல தகராறு ஒன்றுமில்லையே? ஒங்க அப்பா, அம்மாவெல்லாம் உன் மேலே சந்தோஷப்பட்டாங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா, நீ எப்படி நம்ப கடையைக் கண்டு புடிச்சே? இனிமே எங்க உன்னைப் பார்க்கப் போறோம்னுல இருந்தேன், நான். அது சரிதான்...ம், பரவாயில்ல...என்ன, கல்யாணமெல்லாம் இப்போ எவ்வளவு தூரத்திலே இருக்கு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதான்...கல்யாணந்தான்...இப்ப பண்ணிக்கப் போறதில்லைன்னு சொல்லிட்டேனே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம். ஆமாம். அதான் அன்னைக்கே பேப்பர்ல பாத்தேனே...ஆமா, கல்யாணம் பண்ணிக்காம...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எனக்கு ஏதாவது வேலை பார்க்கலாம்னு ஆசை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடே, இது என்னு இது! புதுசா இருக்கே! நீ வேலை பார்க்கிறதாவது...பேஷ் பேஷ்! பணக்கார வீட்டு புள்ளைங்க, வேலை பார்க்கணும்னு சொல்ற குரலை இப்பத்தான் என் ஆயுளிலே முதல் முறையா கேக்கிறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சோம்பேறித்தனமா வாழறது எனக்குப் பிடிக்கிறதே இல்லை. ஏதாவது கெளரவமான வேலை, ஏன் உங்க கம்பெனியில்கூட 'டைப்பிஸ்ட்' வேலை காலியாயிருக்கு போலிருக்கே...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்...அந்த வேலை...நீ, நீ, என்ன லீலா, விளையாடுறே! என் கம்பெனி ரொம்ப சின்னக் கம்பெனி; நீயோ பெரிய வீட்டுப் பெண்ணு; இந்த வேலை எல்லாம் ஒனக்கு சரிப்பட்டு வருமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பரவாயில்லை, அதனால என்ன, பழகின எடமா இருக்கிறது நல்லதுதானே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது சரிதான்...அது சரிதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப இன்னைக்கே வேலையை ஆரம்பிக்கிறேன். 'அப்பாய்ன்ட்மென்ட்' போடுங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பாய்ன்ட்மென்ட்... நமக்குள்ள எதுக்கு இதெல்லாம்? நீ வேலையை ஆரம்பி...அதெல்லாம் நானு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":29,"printed_page":28}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்டு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓ! [ராணி ராஜாவின் வேஷப் போட்டோவைப் பார்ப்பது கண்டு] நீங்க என்ன பாக்குறீங்க? சேரன் செங்குட்டுவன் நாடகத்திலே அய்யாவோட போஸ் இது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!...ஓ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏங்க...அப்ப வெளியிலே மாட்டியிருக்கிற போர்டு...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கழட்டு போ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீங்க நடிகரா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லே, இல்லே. எங்கூட ஒரு அமெச்சூர்ஸ் 'குருப்' இருக்கு. அவுங்க எப்பவாவது நாடகம் போடுவாங்க. என்னையும் ஆக்ட் பண்ண சொல்லுவாங்க; பண்ணுவேன். அன்னைக்கி கூட ஒங்கிட்டே சொன்னேனே, ஒனக்கு ஞாபகம் இருக்காது... ஆ!... நடிப்பே தொழிலல்ல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கலையிலே ஒரு ஆசை போலிருக்கு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s015-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s015","scene_ordinal":15,"transition_audit_id":"T015","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்; ஆமாம்! இப்ப உனக்கு வேலைசெய்யணுங்கிற ஆசையில்லே, அது மாதிரி எனக்கு ஒரு ஆசை.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":30,"printed_page":29}],"source_scene_file":"scene-015.md"}]}
